---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const title = "Kurslar — Tayanch";
const description = "Pullik va bepul kurslar hamda IELTS Mock Test practice mahsuloti: Prompt Engineering, Obsidian, AI Agentlar, IELTS Prep, Admission Process va boshqalar.";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>

<h1 data-i18n="kk.h1">Kurslar</h1>

<div class="course-filter" id="courseFilter">
  <button class="cf-btn active" data-filter="all" data-i18n="kk.fAll">Barchasi</button>
  <button class="cf-btn" data-filter="ai" data-i18n="kk.fAi">AI</button>
  <button class="cf-btn" data-filter="ielts" data-i18n="kk.fIelts">IELTS</button>
  <button class="cf-btn" data-filter="admission" data-i18n="kk.fAdm">Admission</button>
  <button class="cf-btn" data-filter="dizayn" data-i18n="kk.fDes">Dizayn</button>
  <button class="cf-btn" data-filter="hayotiy" data-i18n="kk.fLife">Hayotiy ko'nikka</button>
  <button class="cf-btn" data-filter="bepul" data-i18n="kk.fFree">Bepul</button>
  <button class="cf-btn" data-filter="data" data-i18n="kk.fData">Data</button>
  <button class="cf-btn" data-filter="dasturlash" data-i18n="kk.fDev">Dasturlash</button>
</div>

<div class="course-list">
  <div class="card" style="--c:#7d7df5" data-cat="ai">
    <span class="badge">Mashhur</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9.5 13.9 11.4 12 16l-1.9-4.6L5.5 9.5l4.6-1.9z"/><path d="M19 14l.8 2 2 .8-2 .8-.8 2-.8-2-2-.8 2-.8z"/></svg></div>
    <h2>AI'dan 5 daqiqada sifatli javob</h2>
    <span class="cat">AI · PKM</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>ChatGPT'dan aniq, tuzilgan va ishga yaroqli natija olishni o'rganasiz — bir soatlik ishni 5 daqiqaga tushirasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: yozuvchi, talaba, marketolog va AI'dan tezroq foydalanishni istagan har kimga.</p>
    <p class="price">$29 <span class="uzs">≈ 360 000 so'm</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="prompt-engineering" data-total="7" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/prompt-engineering'} class="start-btn">Kursga yozilish →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#34d399" data-cat="ai">
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/></svg></div>
    <h2>O'qiganingiz esda qoladigan bilim bazasi</h2>
    <span class="cat">AI · PKM</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Kundalik fikr, maqola va darslarni avtomatik tartibga solib, kerak paytda topadigan tizim quraysiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: ko'p o'qiydigan, lekin esida saqlay olmaydigan talaba va mutaxassislarga.</p>
    <p class="price">$19 <span class="uzs">≈ 240 000 so'm</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="obsidian" data-total="6" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/obsidian'} class="start-btn">Bilim bazosi qurish →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#ef4444" data-cat="ai">
    <span class="badge badge-hot">Eng mashhur</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="8" width="16" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M12 8V4M9 2h6M9 12h.01M15 12h.01M9 16h6"/></svg></div>
    <h2>O'z AI yordamchingizni yaratish</h2>
    <span class="cat">AI · PKM</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>CrewAI va LangGraph bilan vazifalarni o'zi bajarib chiqadigan agent tuzasiz — tadqiqot, kontent, avtomatlashtirish. Kimga mo'ljallangan: AI bilan tanishgan va uni haqiqiy ishga qo'llamoqchi bo'lganlarga.</p>
    <p class="price">$39 <span class="uzs">≈ 490 000 so'm</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="ai-agentlar" data-total="7" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/ai-agentlar'} class="start-btn">Agent yaratishni o'rganish →</a>
  </div>

  <section class="ielts-collection" id="ielts-courses" data-cat="ielts">
    <div class="ielts-collection-head"><div><span class="badge badge-new">Yangi</span><h2 data-i18n="kk.ieltsTitle">IELTS 6.5+ band: 30 kunlik reja</h2><p data-i18n="kk.ieltsDesc">Har bir skill alohida, 30 kunlik speaking rejasi bilan — kerakli band'gacha yetib olasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: IELTS 6.5–7.0 kerak bo'lganlarga.</p></div><span class="collection-price" data-i18n="kk.ieltsPrice">Skill-kurslar: $7.50–$14.99 · ≈ 93 750–187 500 so'm</span></div>
    <div class="ielts-course-grid">
      <a class="ielts-mini-card listening" href={base + 'kurslar/ielts-listening'}><span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="ielts-listening" data-total="3" aria-live="polite"></span><b>01</b><h3>Listening</h3><p>Signal, raqam, birlik-ko‘plik va distractor mashqlari.</p><span>$7.50 →</span></a>
      <a class="ielts-mini-card reading" href={base + 'kurslar/ielts-reading'}><span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="ielts-reading" data-total="3" aria-live="polite"></span><b>02</b><h3>Reading</h3><p>Vaqt, savol turi va xato patternlari ustida ishlang.</p><span>$7.50 →</span></a>
      <a class="ielts-mini-card writing" href={base + 'kurslar/ielts-writing'}><span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="ielts-writing" data-total="30" aria-live="polite"></span><b>03</b><h3>Writing</h3><p>AI bilan 30 kunlik Task 1/2 yozma baholash.</p><span>$14.99 →</span></a>
      <a class="ielts-mini-card speaking" href={base + 'kurslar/ielts-speaking'}><span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="ielts-speaking" data-total="30" aria-live="polite"></span><b>04</b><h3>Speaking</h3><p>AI bilan 30 kunlik talaffuz va gapirish mashqi.</p><span>$7.50 →</span></a>
      <a class="ielts-mini-card vocabulary" href={base + 'kurslar/ielts-vocabulary'}><span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="ielts-vocabulary" data-total="2" aria-live="polite"></span><b>05</b><h3>Vocabulary</h3><p>Flashcards va Obsidian bilan so‘zlarni tizimli yodlash.</p><span>Mini-kurs →</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="ielts-bundle"><div><span>IELTS FULL BUNDLE</span><h3 data-i18n="kk.bundleTitle">4 tasini birga oling — 20% tejang</h3><p><s>468 750 so'm</s> o‘rniga <b>375 000 so'm</b>. Listening + Reading + Writing + Speaking birga. To‘lov Telegram orqali qo‘lda tasdiqlanadi.</p></div><a class="start-btn" href={base + 'bog-lanish?course=ielts-full-bundle&price=375000'}>Bundle’ni olish →</a></div>
  </section>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#7d7df5" data-cat="ielts">
    <span class="badge badge-new">Yangi</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 5h16v14H4z"/><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M7 11h10M7 15h6"/></svg></div>
    <h2>IELTS imtihonini uyida sinab ko'rish</h2>
    <span class="cat">IELTS · Practice</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/></svg>Tayanch Qadam bilan</span>
    <p>Listening, Reading, Writing va Speaking'ni alohida yoki to'liq mock sifatida mashq qilib, haqiqiy imtihon stressiz o'tasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: yaqin orada IELTS topshiradigan nomzodlarga.</p>
    <p class="price">1 Qadamdan <span class="uzs">≈ 32 000 so‘m / modul</span></p>

    <a href={base + 'ielts-mock/'} class="start-btn">Mockni boshlash →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#22d3ee" data-cat="ai">
    <span class="badge badge-new">Yangi</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 18l6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></div>
    <h2>G'oyadan 2 haftada saytgacha</h2>
    <span class="cat">AI · PKM</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>AI agentlari yordamida bepul/arzon vositalar bilan haqiqiy sayt yoki loyiha quraysiz — dasturlash tajribasisiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: g'oyasi bor, lekin kod yozishni bilmaydigan tadbirkor va yaradorlarga.</p>
    <p class="price">Tez orada <span class="uzs">Bepul / arzon AI</span></p>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/vibe-coding'} class="start-btn">Sayt qurishni o'rganish →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#8b5cf6" data-cat="admission">
    <span class="badge badge-new">Yangi</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M9 15l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Chet elga qabul: hujjatdan intervyugacha</h2>
    <span class="cat">Til · Admission</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Arizadan essay va suhbatgacha bo'lgan yo'lni bosqichma-bosqich o'tasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: xorijda o'qish niyatida bo'lgan talabalarga.</p>
    <p class="price">49 000 so'mdan <span class="uzs">3 qism alohida tanlanadi</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="admission-process" data-total="12" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/admission-process'} class="start-btn">Qabulga tayyorlanish →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#7d7df5" data-cat="ai">
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M5 12v8a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-8M12 8v13M12 8S10 3 7.5 4.5 9 8 12 8zM12 8s2-5 4.5-3.5S15 8 12 8z"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Pullik obuna bermasdan AI'dan foydalanish</h2>
    <span class="cat">AI</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Kompyuteringizda ishlaydigan bepul AI vositalari va agentlar ro'yxatini o'rganasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: xarajatni kamaytirib, AI'dan foydalanishni istaganlarga.</p>
    <p class="price">$19 <span class="uzs">≈ 240 000 so'm</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="tekin-ai" data-total="6" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/tekin-ai'} class="start-btn">Bepul AI ko'rish →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#3b82f6" data-cat="hayotiy">
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-14h-7l1-8z"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Mac'da ishni 2 baravar tezroq bajarish</h2>
    <span class="cat">HAYOTIY KO'NIKMA</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Raycast va shortcut'lar bilan bir soatlik ishni yarim soatga tushirasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: Mac foydalanuvchilari, talaba va freelancer'larga.</p>
    <p class="price">$15 <span class="uzs">≈ 190 000 so'm</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="mac-tezlik-sirlari" data-total="8" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/mac-tezlik-sirlari'} class="start-btn">Tezroq ishlash →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#f59e0b" data-cat="bepul dizayn">
    <span class="badge badge-new">Yangi</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z"/><path d="M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z"/><path d="M2 2l7.586 7.586"/><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="2"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Bepul Figma: UI/UX asoslarini 1 kunda</h2>
    <span class="cat">Dizayn</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Interfeys chizish, komponent va prototip yasashni bepul o'rganasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: dizaynga kirishmoqchi bo'lgan yangi boshlovchilarga. Keyinroq "Vibe Coding" kursida dizayndan haqiqiy mahsulot quraysiz.</p>
    <p class="price">$0 <span class="uzs">Bepul</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="figma" data-total="7" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/figma'} class="start-btn">Bepul dizaynni boshlash →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#f97316" data-cat="dizayn">
    <span class="badge badge-new">Yangi</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3h18v18H3zM3 9h18M9 3v18M15 9v12"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Mac'da chizma: bepul talaba litsenziyasi</h2>
    <span class="cat">Dizayn · Muhandislik</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>AutoCAD o'rnatish, chizish va birinchi chizmani tayyorlashni o'rganasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: muhandislik talabalari va texnik chizmachi bo'lmoqchi bo'lganlarga.</p>
    <p class="price">$29 <span class="uzs">≈ 360 000 so'm</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="autocad-on-mac" data-total="10" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/autocad-on-mac'} class="start-btn">Chizishni o'rganish →</a>
  </div>


  <div class="card" style="--c:#14b8a6" data-cat="bepul admission">
    <span class="badge badge-free">Bepul</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10 12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c0 1 2.5 3 6 3s6-2 6-3v-5"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Nima uchun chet elda o'qish kerak (va bepul qanday)</h2>
    <span class="cat">Bepul · Admission</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Xorijda o'qishning 5 asosiy foydasini va bepul grant topish yo'llarini bilib olasiz. Kimga mo'ljallangan: chet elga intilayotgan talabalarga. To'liq tayyorgarlik uchun "Admission Process" pullik kursiga o'ting.</p>
    <p class="price">$0 <span class="uzs">Bepul</span></p>

    <span class="course-card-progress" data-course-progress-meter data-course-id="chet-elda-oqish" data-total="5" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/chet-elda-oqish'} class="start-btn">Bepul kursni ko'rish →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#0ea5e9" data-cat="data">
    <span class="badge badge-new">Yangi</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="11" width="3" height="7"/><rect x="12" y="7" width="3" height="11"/><rect x="17" y="13" width="3" height="5"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Data Analytics — Ma'lumotlar tahlili</h2>
    <span class="cat">AI · Data</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Excel'dan SQL va Python'gacha — ma'lumotlar bilan ishlash va qaror qabul qilish.</p>
    <p class="price">Tez orada <span class="uzs">Narx belgilanmoqda</span></p>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/data-analytics'} class="start-btn">Kursni ko'rish →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#10b981" data-cat="dasturlash">
    <span class="badge badge-new">Yangi</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 18l6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Backend Development — Python</h2>
    <span class="cat">IT · Dasturlash</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Python, FastAPI va ma'lumotlar bazasi bilan server tomonidan ishlaydigan ilova qurish.</p>
    <p class="price">Tez orada <span class="uzs">Narx belgilanmoqda</span></p>
    <a href={base + 'kurslar/backend-python'} class="start-btn">Kursni ko'rish →</a>
  </div>


</div>


<section class="upcoming-courses" aria-labelledby="upcoming-courses-title">
  <div class="upcoming-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">KELAYOTGAN KURSLAR</p>
    <h2 id="upcoming-courses-title" data-i18n="kk.upTitle">Material tayyorlanmoqda</h2>
    <p data-i18n="kk.upDesc">Bu kurslar ustida ish davom etmoqda. To‘liq material va sotuv ochilganda e’lon qilinadi.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="upcoming-grid">
  <div class="card" style="--c:#10b981" data-cat="hayotiy">
    <span class="badge badge-soon">Kelayotgan</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7h18v12H3z"/><path d="M3 7l2-3h11l2 3"/><circle cx="17" cy="13" r="1.6"/></svg></div>
    <h2>Financial Literacy — Moliyaviy savodxonlik</h2>
    <span class="cat">HAYOTIY KO'NIKMA</span>
    <span class="cert-line"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M9 13.5 7.5 21 12 18l4.5 3L15 13.5"/></svg>Sertifikat bilan</span>
    <p>Pulni boshqarish, byudjet tuzish va moliyaviy qarorlar — talaba hayoti uchun asosiy ko'nikmalar.</p>
      <p class="upcoming-status">Narx va dastur tez orada e'lon qilinadi</p>
      <span class="start-btn is-disabled" aria-disabled="true">Tayyorlanmoqda</span>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="--c:#ec4899" data-cat="admission">
    <span class="badge badge-new">Tez orada</span>
    <div class="c-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0z"/><path d="M12 4V2M9 2h6"/></svg></div>
    <h2>El-Yurt Umidi'ni yutaylik</h2>
    <span class="cat">Admission</span>
